msgstr " ROYE "

#: kwritemain.cpp:270
msgid "Open File"
msgstr "Drovi fitchî"

#: kwritemain.cpp:285
msgid ""
"The given file could not be read, check if it exists or if it is readable "
"for the current user."
msgstr ""
"Dji n' a nén savou lére li fitchî dné, verifyîz s' il léjhåve po l' uzeu do "
"moumint."

